{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216050","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721605001:1":{"text":"귀네스 경, 정말 대단하세요! 이런 실력과 운이라니, 역시 근위대 분대장다우시네요!","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，你太厉害了！这实力和运气，不愧是守备军的队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2F58B7DB6F451E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721605002:1":{"text":"오늘 다 나쁜 일만 있는 건 아니네요. 적어도 랜덤 박스는 노력한 만큼 보상을 받았으니까요.","source_cn":"看来，我今天遇见的也不全是坏事。至少在宝盒这里，付出就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450A91BE3B6C31A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721605003:1":{"text":"당연하죠! 귀네스 경처럼 배짱과 운을 가지신 분이라면 뭐든 다 잘될 거예요!","source_cn":"那是当然！像您这样既有魄力又有运气的人，无论做什么肯定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719664224A38DBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721605004:1":{"text":"“전리품” 잘 챙기시고요, 다음에 또 오세요!","source_cn":"记得拿好您的“战利品”，欢迎下次光临哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D9EBC24C3965F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银职员爱丽丝":{"text":"미스릴 직원 앨리스","source":"秘银职员爱丽丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}